# Local index cache — per-clone, regenerable, never source-of-truth (D-023).
# Includes seq.json + cache.db. The audit log moved to Postgres
# (rule_01KRKQDHWNWJAF4YKTMCB2A0D9). Files-not-directory pattern so
# the v15 connections pointer file (.doco/connections.md) can be
# re-included.
.doco/*
# v15 (decision_01KS3DX190V93NGR3QQ37J8TVQ): the connections pointer
# file IS committed. Replaces the legacy DOCO.md.
!.doco/connections.md

